bsp;是南北向雙面窗&nbsp;再加廁有窗&nbsp;共有三面窗&nbsp;通風好&nbsp;房友住戶單純經過濾的正常上班族&nbsp;&nbsp;與對面棟的距離空間寬遠&nbsp;也很通風</b></span></p><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\"><b>房友調日本&nbsp;邀正常工作女性一位加入&nbsp;共同維護居家好環境</b></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近板南線公車站、環狀線民生站公車站、新埔捷運站、新埔民生捷運站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區光武街2巷", "lat": "25.0255354", "lng": "121.4685652", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "新埔民生站", "distance": 194, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約194公尺"}, {"type": "subway", "name": "新埔站", "distance": 198, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約198公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "捷運新埔站(文化路)", "distance": 87, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約87公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "豚將日本拉麵", "distance": 52, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約52公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "三猿廣場", "distance": 219, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約219公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市板橋區江翠國民中學", "distance": 371, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約371公尺"}, {"type": "primary", "name": "莒光國小風雨操場", "distance": 496, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約496公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "14,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "車位租金", "value": "費用另計", "key": "carportPrice"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路、清潔費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "9坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "車位", "value": "平面式", "key": "carInfo", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆", "key": "space